          <h3>Memorize the 7 Falsy Values</h3>
          <p><code>false</code>, <code>0</code>, <code>-0</code>, <code>""</code>, <code>null</code>, <code>undefined</code>, <code>NaN</code> — these are the only falsy values in JavaScript.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class='tip-card'>
